<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>’Tis from such a Jesus came</l><l>The Spirit of Jesus to us,</l><l>To make His reality</l><l>Experience unto us.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The Spirit of Jesus has</l><l>All elements human, divine,</l><l>The living of man in Him</l><l>And glory of God combine.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>The suff’ring of human life,</l><l>Effectiveness of His death,</l><l>His rising and reigning too</l><l>Are all in the Spirit’s breath.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>With all these components true</l><l>His Spirit in us doth move,</l><l>And by His anointing full</l><l>The riches of Christ we prove.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>This Spirit of Jesus doth</l><l>Encompass both great and small;</l><l>Inclusively He doth work</l><l>In us, making God our all.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
